// A parenthesised pattern, which `pattern_body` gives the span of the parens
// rather than of what is inside them — `parser.rs`'s `inner.span = open.to(close)`.
//
// This fixture exists because a mutation found the hole: `arm-harness.sh` #3
// removes that rewrite, and with the corpus, the twenty-five other fixtures and
// all 716 mined inputs the comparison stayed **green**. Ninety-two of ninety-two
// node tags were reached and this decision still was not, which is the whole
// argument against tag coverage as a stopping rule.
fn f(v) = match v {
  (x) -> x,
  ((y)) -> y,
  (1) -> 0,
  (A(z)) -> z,
  ([a, ..r]) -> a,
}
